  "content": "<!-- 标题图片 -->\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WFXnzNx.png\" alt=\"标题图1\" style=\"margin-right:10px;\">\n</p>\n\n<!-- 社交徽章 -->\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@nightbeamstudio\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/organization/nightbeam\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://nightbeam.gitbook.io/remnants/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=文档&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=read-the-docs&logoColor=white\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<!-- 分区标题 -->\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 40px 0;\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" alt=\"关于标题\">\n</p>\n\n<!-- YouTube视频 -->\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n  <iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/8djzQBruLto\" title=\"YouTube视频播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 关于部分 -->\n<p style=\"font-size: 1.1em; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n  诞生于地狱深处的<strong>遗骸</strong>，融合了亡灵的不死韧性，与远古战斗大师的致命精准。无论你是经验丰富的冒险家，还是寻求下一场激战的刺激追求者，这款模组都将带来心跳加速的体验。\n</p>\n\n<!-- Ko-fi按钮 -->\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/nightbeamstudio\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/670f5a0171bfb928b21a7e00_support_me_on_kofi_beige.png\" width=\"240\" alt=\"在Ko-fi上支持我\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<!-- 特性标题 -->\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" alt=\"特性\">\n</p>\n\n<!-- 首领部分 -->\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center; color:#e03e2d;\">遗骸·骨影</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center; max-width:800px; margin:0 auto;\">\n  一位神秘的骷髅忍者，以速度、诡计和致命精准主宰战场。\n</p>\n\n<h3>能力</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>影袭冲刺：</strong>高速突刺攻击，可穿透玩家。</li>\n  <li><strong>苦无弹幕：</strong>投掷带有自定义飞行动画的旋转苦无。</li>\n  <li><strong>瞬身斩：</strong>短暂消失后出现在毫无防备的玩家身后。</li>\n  <li><strong>相位切换模式：</strong>暴怒时获得新攻击模式与强化速度。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>战斗体验</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>适合地下城竞技场或后期游戏进程。</li>\n  <li>包含<strong>自定义材质、模型、动画与音效</strong>（冲刺、攻击、主题音乐）。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<!-- 随从部分 -->\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center; color:#3598db;\">骷髅随从</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center; max-width:800px; margin:0 auto;\">\n  骨影由亡灵随从伴随，在战斗中为其提供支援。\n</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>近战骷髅战士：</strong>高速移动的突袭型攻击者。</li>\n  <li><strong>护卫随从：</strong>在首领脆弱阶段提供保护。</li>\n  <li><strong>波次召唤：</strong>根据首领生命值阈值召唤额外随从。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center; color:#e03e2d;\">变异鼠群</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center; max-width:800px; margin:0 auto;\">\n  在遗迹、洞穴与地牢中穿梭，为首领战之前增添危险。\n</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>默认鼠、灰鼠、黄鼠、蓝鼠</li>\n</ul>\n\n<!-- 横幅图片 -->\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://builtbybit.com/resources/brainrot-monster-pack-vol-1.73973\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8699b70f53dfa1fc1d907589e24564027bb64c26.png\" alt=\"横幅1\" style=\"margin-right:10px;\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://builtbybit.com/resources/brainrot-monster-pack-vol-2.76296\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8874ac9cb5749b4f1c4e6e07036224137838b414.png\" alt=\"横幅2\"></a>\n</p>",
